      "y": 32,
      "src": "VIGA DE HORMIGÓN ARMADO A FLEXIÓN Y CORTE — el caso canónico del Cap. 9"
    },
    {
      "id": "r001",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 80,
      "src": "ACI 318-25 (edición SI) · Cap. 9 + 22.2/22.3 (flexión) + 22.5 (corte) · Tablas 21.2.1 y 21.2.2"
    },
    {
      "id": "r002",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 128,
      "src": "Rd_ = capacidad de diseño (incluye phi) · las comparaciones dan ✓/✗"
    },
    {
      "id": "r003",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 176,
      "src": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "r004",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 192,
      "src": "Los coeficientes empíricos se leen en la EDICIÓN SI del código, en MPa, y se"
    },
    {
      "id": "r005",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 240,
      "src": "aplican tal cual. No son los mismos que los de la edición inch-pound escritos"
    },
    {
      "id": "r006",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 288,
      "src": "en kgf/cm²: 2√f'c psi = 0,53√f'c en kgf/cm², pero 0,17λ√f'c MPa = 0,543√f'c."
    },
    {
      "id": "r007",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 336,
      "src": "ACI redondea distinto en cada edición y la diferencia llega al 2,4 %."
    },
    {
      "id": "r008",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 400,
      "src": "━━ DATOS · MATERIALES ━━"
    },
    {
      "id": "r009",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 448,
      "src": "Hormigón G25 y acero A630-420H, como los declara el post. f'c y f_y son"
    },
    {
      "id": "r010",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 496,
      "src": "frontera declarada; lo demás se deriva."
    },
    {
      "id": "r011",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 544,
      "src": "f_c := 250 kgf/cm^2"
    },
    {
      "id": "r012",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 592,
      "src": "f_y := 4200 kgf/cm^2"
    },
    {
      "id": "r013",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 640,
      "src": "f_yt := f_y"
    },
    {
      "id": "r014",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 688,
      "src": "El radicando de las expresiones de corte va en MPa (edición SI):"
    },
    {
      "id": "r015",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 736,
      "src": "f_cM := f_c = MPa"
    },
    {
      "id": "r016",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 784,
      "src": "rfc := sqrt(f_c/MPa)*MPa = MPa"
    },
    {
      "id": "r017",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 832,
      "src": "20.2.2.2: se permite tomar E_s = 200 000 MPa para barras no pretensadas."
    },
    {
      "id": "r018",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 880,
      "src": "E_s := 200000 MPa"
    },
    {
      "id": "r019",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 928,
      "src": "eps_ty := f_y/E_s ="
    },
    {
      "id": "r020",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 976,
      "src": "19.2.4.2: hormigón de densidad normal → λ = 1"
    },
    {
      "id": "r021",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1024,
      "src": "lam := 1"
    },
    {
      "id": "r022",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1072,
      "src": "22.2.2.1: deformación útil máxima del hormigón en compresión"
    },
    {
      "id": "r023",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1120,
      "src": "eps_cu := 0.003"
    },
    {
      "id": "r024",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1168,
      "src": "Tabla 22.2.2.4.3(a): β1 = 0,85 para 17 ≤ f'c ≤ 28 MPa"
    },
    {
      "id": "r025",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1216,
      "src": "beta_1 := beta1(f_c) ="
    },
    {
      "id": "v_b1",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1264,
      "src": "v_b1 := f_cM >= 17 MPa and f_cM <= 28 MPa ="
    },
    {
      "id": "r027",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1328,
      "src": "━━ DATOS · FACTORES φ ━━"
    },
    {
      "id": "r028",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1376,
      "src": "Tabla 21.2.2(f): φ = 0,90 si la sección es controlada por tracción (se verifica)."
    },
    {
      "id": "r029",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1424,
      "src": "phi_f := 0.90"
    },
    {
      "id": "r030",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1472,
      "src": "Tabla 21.2.1: φ = 0,75 para cortante."
    },
    {
      "id": "r031",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1520,
      "src": "phi_v := 0.75"
    },
    {
      "id": "r032",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1584,
      "src": "━━ DATOS · GEOMETRÍA Y ARMADURA ━━"
    },
    {
      "id": "r033",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1632,
      "src": "b_w := 30 cm"
    },
    {
      "id": "r034",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1680,
      "src": "h := 60 cm"
    },
    {
      "id": "r035",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1728,
      "src": "L := 6.0 m"
    },
    {
      "id": "r036",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1776,
      "src": "Tabla 20.5.1.3.1: vigas no expuestas a la intemperie ni en contacto con el"
    },
    {
      "id": "r037",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1824,
      "src": "suelo → recubrimiento especificado 40 mm, medido a la cara del estribo."
    },
    {
      "id": "r038",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1872,
      "src": "rec := 40 mm"
    },
    {
      "id": "r039",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1920,
      "src": "d_e := 10 mm"
    },
    {
      "id": "r040",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1968,
      "src": "d_b := 25 mm"
    },
    {
      "id": "r041",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2016,
      "src": "n_b := 3"
    },
    {
      "id": "r042",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2064,
      "src": "Frontera declarada: el área NOMINAL de la barra. A_s, d y b·d se derivan."
    },
    {
      "id": "r043",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2112,
      "src": "A_b := pi/4*d_b^2 = cm^2"
    },
    {
      "id": "r044",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2160,
      "src": "A_s := n_b*A_b = cm^2"
    },
    {
      "id": "r045",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2208,
      "src": "Altura útil: se DERIVA de la disposición de barras, no se declara."
    },
    {
      "id": "r046",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2256,
      "src": "d := h - rec - d_e - d_b/2 = cm"
    },
    {
      "id": "r047",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2304,
      "src": "25.2.1: separación libre ≥ la mayor de 25 mm, d_b y 4/3 d_agg (una capa)."
    },
    {
      "id": "r048",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2352,
      "src": "s_libre := (b_w - 2*rec - 2*d_e - n_b*d_b)/(n_b - 1) = mm"
    },
    {
      "id": "v_sep",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2400,
      "src": "v_sep := s_libre >= max(25 mm, d_b) ="
    },
    {
      "id": "r050",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2464,
      "src": "━━ CARGAS Y SOLICITACIONES ━━"
    },
    {
      "id": "r051",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2512,
      "src": "D := 3.0 tonf/m"
    },
    {
      "id": "r052",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2560,
      "src": "L_v := 1.5 tonf/m"
    },
    {
      "id": "r053",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2608,
      "src": "Tabla 5.3.1, Ec. (5.3.1b): U = 1,2D + 1,6L + (0,5L_r ó 0,3S ó 0,5R), nulos acá."
    },
    {
      "id": "r054",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2656,
      "src": "w_u := 1.2*D + 1.6*L_v = tonf/m"
    },
    {
      "id": "r055",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2704,
      "src": "M_u := w_u*L^2/8 = tonf*m"
    },
    {
      "id": "r056",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2752,
      "src": "V_uap := w_u*L/2 = tonf"
    },
    {
      "id": "r057",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2800,
      "src": "9.4.3.2: la sección crítica de corte está a d de la CARA del apoyo, y se"
    },
    {
      "id": "r058",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2848,
      "src": "permite si (a) el apoyo comprime el extremo, (b) la carga llega por arriba y"
    },
    {
      "id": "r059",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2896,
      "src": "(c) no hay puntual entremedio — las tres se cumplen. Sin ancho de apoyo"
    },
    {
      "id": "r060",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2944,
      "src": "declarado se mide desde el eje: es la lectura conservadora."
    },
    {
      "id": "r061",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2992,
      "src": "V_ud := w_u*(L/2 - d) = tonf"
    },
    {
      "id": "r062",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 3056,
      "src": "━━ 1 · ALTURA MÍNIMA SIN CALCULAR DEFLEXIONES (Tabla 9.3.1.1) ━━"
    },
    {
      "id": "r063",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 3104,
      "src": "Simplemente apoyada → h_min = ℓ/16. La nota [1] la da para hormigón de"
    },
    {
      "id": "r064",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 3152,
      "src": "densidad normal y f_y = 420 MPa; A630-420H es Grado 420, sin modificador."
    },
    {
      "id": "r065",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 3200,
      "src": "h_min := L/16 = cm"
    },
    {
      "id": "v_h",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 3248,
      "src": "v_h := h >= h_min ="
    },
    {
      "id": "r067",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 3296,
      "src": "u_h := h_min/h ="
    },
    {
      "id": "r068",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 3360,
      "src": "━━ 2 · FLEXIÓN — BLOQUE RECTANGULAR EQUIVALENTE (22.2.2.4) ━━"
    },
    {
      "id": "r069",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 3408,
      "src": "22.2.2.4.1: compresión uniforme de 0,85f'c sobre una altura a = β1·c."
    },
    {
      "id": "r070",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 3456,
      "src": "a := A_s*f_y/(0.85*f_c*b_w) = cm"
    },
    {
      "id": "r071",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 3504,
      "src": "c := a/beta_1 = cm"
    },
    {
      "id": "r072",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 3552,
      "src": "22.2.1.2 + Fig. R21.2.2a: ε_t por compatibilidad de deformaciones."
    },
    {
      "id": "r073",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 3600,
      "src": "eps_t := eps_cu*(d - c)/c ="
    },
    {
      "id": "r074",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 3648,
      "src": "cdt := c/d ="
    },
    {
      "id": "r075",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 3712,
      "src": "━━ 2.1 · DUCTILIDAD: ¿CONTROLADA POR TRACCIÓN? (9.3.3.1 + Tabla 21.2.2) ━━"
    },
    {
      "id": "r076",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 3760,
      "src": "9.3.3.1: una viga con P_u < 0,10f'c·A_g debe ser controlada por tracción."
    },
    {
      "id": "r077",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 3808,
      "src": "eps_lim := eps_ty + 0.003 ="
    },
    {
      "id": "v_duct",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 3856,
      "src": "v_duct := eps_t >= eps_lim ="
    },
    {
      "id": "r079",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 3904,
      "src": "El φ que sale de la Tabla 21.2.2 con ese ε_t, contra el φ = 0,90 supuesto:"
    },
    {
      "id": "r080",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 3952,
      "src": "phi_chk := phiFlexion(eps_t, eps_ty) ="
    },
    {
      "id": "v_phi",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 4000,
      "src": "v_phi := phi_chk == phi_f ="
    },
    {
      "id": "r082",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 4048,
      "src": "El mismo límite en forma geométrica: c/d_t ≤ ε_cu/(ε_cu + ε_lim)."
    },
    {
      "id": "r083",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 4096,
      "src": "cdt_lim := eps_cu/(eps_cu + eps_lim) ="
    },
    {
      "id": "v_cdt",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 4144,
      "src": "v_cdt := cdt <= cdt_lim ="
    },
    {
      "id": "r085",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 4208,
      "src": "━━ 2.2 · RESISTENCIA A FLEXIÓN (22.3.1) Y CONDICIÓN 9.5.1.1(a) ━━"
    },
    {
      "id": "r086",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 4256,
      "src": "9.5.1.1(a): φM_n ≥ M_u. NO es 9.3.2.1, que son los límites de deflexión"
    },
    {
      "id": "r087",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 4304,
      "src": "calculada; en 318-25 la condición de resistencia de la viga es 9.5.1.1."
    },
    {
      "id": "r088",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 4352,
      "src": "M_n := A_s*f_y*(d - a/2) = tonf*m"
    },
    {
      "id": "r089",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 4400,
      "src": "Rd_M := phi_f*M_n = tonf*m"
    },
    {
      "id": "v_M",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 4448,
      "src": "v_M := Rd_M >= M_u ="
    },
    {
      "id": "r091",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 4496,
      "src": "u_M := M_u/Rd_M ="
    },
    {
      "id": "r092",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 4560,
      "src": "━━ 2.3 · REFUERZO MÍNIMO A FLEXIÓN (9.6.1.2) ━━"
    },
    {
      "id": "r093",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 4608,
      "src": "A_s,min = el mayor de (a) 0,25√f'c/f_y·b_w·d y (b) 1,4/f_y·b_w·d, en MPa."
    },
    {
      "id": "r094",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 4656,
      "src": "rho_a := 0.25*rfc/f_y ="
    },
    {
      "id": "r095",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 4704,
      "src": "rho_b := 1.4 MPa/f_y ="
    },
    {
      "id": "r096",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 4752,
      "src": "A_smin := max(rho_a, rho_b)*b_w*d = cm^2"
    },
    {
      "id": "v_Asmin",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 4800,
      "src": "v_Asmin := A_s >= A_smin ="
    },
    {
      "id": "r098",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 4848,
      "src": "Gobierna el término (b), el piso para hormigones corrientes:"
    },
    {
      "id": "v_gob",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 4896,
      "src": "v_gob := rho_b > rho_a ="
    },
    {
      "id": "r100",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 4960,
      "src": "━━ 3 · CORTE — APORTE DEL HORMIGÓN (Tabla 22.5.5.1) ━━"
    },
    {
      "id": "r101",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5008,
      "src": "Con A_v ≥ A_v,min rige la primera fila, y de sus dos opciones se toma la (a),"
    },
    {
      "id": "r102",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5056,
      "src": "la simple: V_c = [0,17λ√f'c + N_u/(6A_g)]·b_w·d, con N_u = 0."
    },
    {
      "id": "r103",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5104,
      "src": "V_c := 0.17*lam*rfc*b_w*d = tonf"
    },
    {
      "id": "r104",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5152,
      "src": "Rd_Vc := phi_v*V_c = tonf"
    },
    {
      "id": "r105",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5200,
      "src": "22.5.5.1.1: V_c ≤ 0,42λ√f'c·b_w·d y V_c ≥ 0,083λ√f'c·b_w·d."
    },
    {
      "id": "r106",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5248,
      "src": "V_ctop := 0.42*lam*rfc*b_w*d = tonf"
    },
    {
      "id": "r107",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5296,
      "src": "V_cpiso := 0.083*lam*rfc*b_w*d = tonf"
    },
    {
      "id": "v_Vcrango",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5344,
      "src": "v_Vcrango := V_c <= V_ctop and V_c >= V_cpiso ="
    },
    {
      "id": "r109",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5392,
      "src": "9.6.3.1: se exige A_v,min donde V_u > φ·0,083λ√f'c·b_w·d. (La edición SI"
    },
    {
      "id": "r110",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5440,
      "src": "imprime esa expresión sin el coeficiente; 0,083 es el valor de 318-19, y el"
    },
    {
      "id": "r111",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5488,
      "src": "que reproduce el 0,5√f'c de la edición inch-pound.)"
    },
    {
      "id": "r112",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5536,
      "src": "V_trig := phi_v*V_cpiso = tonf"
    },
    {
      "id": "v_trig",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5584,
      "src": "v_trig := V_ud > V_trig ="
    },
    {
      "id": "r114",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5632,
      "src": "Y como además V_u@d > φV_c, los estribos tienen que tomar el resto:"
    },
    {
      "id": "v_estribos",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5680,
      "src": "v_estribos := V_ud > Rd_Vc ="
    },
    {
      "id": "r116",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5744,
      "src": "━━ 3.1 · ESTRIBOS REQUERIDOS (22.5.8.1 y Ec. 22.5.8.5.3) ━━"
    },
    {
      "id": "r117",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5792,
      "src": "22.5.8.1: donde V_u > φV_c, V_s ≥ V_u/φ − V_c. (En 318-19 esto era 22.5.10;"
    },
    {
      "id": "r118",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5840,
      "src": "318-25 lo renumeró a 22.5.8.)"
    },
    {
      "id": "r119",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5888,
      "src": "V_sreq := V_ud/phi_v - V_c = tonf"
    },
    {
      "id": "r120",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5936,
      "src": "22.5.1.2: la sección debe cumplir V_u ≤ φ(V_c + 0,66λ√f'c·b_w·d) — el tope"
    },
    {
      "id": "r121",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5984,
      "src": "que protege la biela comprimida del alma."
    },
    {
      "id": "r122",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6032,
      "src": "V_stop := 0.66*lam*rfc*b_w*d = tonf"
    },
    {
      "id": "r123",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6080,
      "src": "V_umax := phi_v*(V_c + V_stop) = tonf"
    },
    {
      "id": "v_biela",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6128,
      "src": "v_biela := V_ud <= V_umax ="
    },
    {
      "id": "r125",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6176,
      "src": "u_biela := V_sreq/V_stop ="
    },
    {
      "id": "r126",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6224,
      "src": "Estribo φ10 de dos ramas. 22.5.8.5.5: A_v es el área de TODAS las ramas."
    },
    {
      "id": "r127",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6272,
      "src": "d_v := 10 mm"
    },
    {
      "id": "r128",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6320,
      "src": "n_r := 2"
    },
    {
      "id": "r129",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6368,
      "src": "A_v := n_r*pi/4*d_v^2 = cm^2"
    },
    {
      "id": "r130",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6416,
      "src": "Ec. (22.5.8.5.3) despejando s: s = A_v·f_yt·d/V_s."
    },
    {
      "id": "r131",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6464,
      "src": "s_req := A_v*f_yt*d/V_sreq = cm"
    },
    {
      "id": "r132",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6528,
      "src": "━━ 3.2 · ESPACIAMIENTO MÁXIMO (Tabla 9.7.6.2.2 y Tabla 9.6.3.4) ━━"
    },
    {
      "id": "r133",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6576,
      "src": "Tabla 9.7.6.2.2: si V_s ≤ 0,33λ√f'c·b_w·d, s ≤ la menor de d/2 y 600 mm; si"
    },
    {
      "id": "r134",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6624,
      "src": "lo supera, la menor de d/4 y 300 mm. (Es el 4√f'c psi de la otra edición.)"
    },
    {
      "id": "r135",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6672,
      "src": "V_sumb := 0.33*lam*rfc*b_w*d = tonf"
    },
    {
      "id": "r136",
      "kind": "program",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6720,
      "src": "s_max :=\n    if V_sreq <= V_sumb\n        return min(d/2, 600 mm)\n    return min(d/4, 300 mm)"
    },
    {
      "id": "r137",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6816,
      "src": "Tabla 9.6.3.4(a)(b): A_v,min/s = el mayor de 0,062√f'c·b_w/f_yt y 0,35·b_w/f_yt."
    },
    {
      "id": "r138",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6864,
      "src": "avs_a := 0.062*rfc*b_w/f_yt = mm^2/mm"
    },
    {
      "id": "r139",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6912,
      "src": "avs_b := 0.35 MPa*b_w/f_yt = mm^2/mm"
    },
    {
      "id": "r140",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6960,
      "src": "avs := max(avs_a, avs_b) = mm^2/mm"
    },
    {
      "id": "r141",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 7008,
      "src": "s_Avmin := A_v/avs = cm"
    },
    {
      "id": "r142",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 7056,
      "src": "El espaciamiento que gobierna y el adoptado:"
    },
    {
      "id": "r143",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 7104,
      "src": "s_gob := min(s_max, s_Avmin) = cm"
    },
    {
      "id": "r144",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 7152,
      "src": "s := 25 cm"
    },
    {
      "id": "v_s",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 7200,
      "src": "v_s := s <= s_gob ="
    },
    {
      "id": "r146",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 7248,
      "src": "Gobierna el detallado, no la resistencia: s_req es mucho mayor que s_gob."
    },
    {
      "id": "v_detalla",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 7296,
      "src": "v_detalla := s_req > s_gob ="
    },
    {
      "id": "r148",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 7360,
      "src": "━━ 3.3 · CAPACIDAD PROVISTA AL CORTE ━━"
    },
    {
      "id": "r149",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 7408,
      "src": "V_s := A_v*f_yt*d/s = tonf"
    },
    {
      "id": "r150",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 7456,
      "src": "Rd_V := phi_v*(V_c + V_s) = tonf"
    },
    {
      "id": "v_V",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 7504,
      "src": "v_V := Rd_V >= V_ud ="
    },
    {
      "id": "r152",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 7552,
      "src": "u_V := V_ud/Rd_V ="
    },
    {
      "id": "r153",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 7616,
      "src": "━━ 4 · DETALLADO ━━"
    },
    {
      "id": "r154",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 7664,
      "src": "9.7.2.3: armadura de piel solo si h > 900 mm."
    },
    {
      "id": "v_piel",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 7712,
      "src": "v_piel := h <= 900 mm ="
    },
    {
      "id": "r156",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 7760,
      "src": "9.7.7.1: en vigas perimetrales, al menos 1/4 del acero positivo máximo debe"
    },
    {
      "id": "r157",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 7808,
      "src": "ser continuo — con 3 φ25, una barra alcanza."
    },
    {
      "id": "r158",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 7856,
      "src": "A_sint := A_s/4 = cm^2"
    },
    {
      "id": "r159",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 7904,
      "src": "n_int := ceil(A_sint/A_b) ="
    },
    {
      "id": "v_int",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 7952,
      "src": "v_int := n_int <= n_b ="
    },
    {
      "id": "esq",
      "kind": "image",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 8000,
      "src": "/esquemas/viga-flexion-corte.svg",
      "w": 640,
      "h": 400
    },
    {
      "id": "r162",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 8448,
      "src": "━━ 5 · LOS COEFICIENTES: LAS DOS COLUMNAS DE ACI 318 ━━"
    },
    {
      "id": "r163",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 8496,
      "src": "ACI 318 se publica en dos ediciones y sus coeficientes empíricos NO son conversiones"
    },
    {
      "id": "r164",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 8544,
      "src": "exactas una de otra: el 2√f'c psi del corte es 0,17λ√f'c MPa, y cada una redondea por"
    },
    {
      "id": "r165",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 8592,
      "src": "su lado. En kgf/cm² eso da 0,53 contra 0,543 — un 2,4 % que ninguna aritmética delata."
    },
    {
      "id": "r166",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 8640,
      "src": "Acá manda la columna métrica, que para ACI es la edición SI. El factor de conversión de"
    },
    {
      "id": "r167",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 8688,
      "src": "un coeficiente de √f'c entre MPa y kgf/cm² es √(1 MPa / 1 kgf/cm²):"
    },
    {
      "id": "r168",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 8736,
      "src": "fconv := sqrt(1 MPa/(1 kgf/cm^2)) ="
    },
    {
      "id": "r169",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 8784,
      "src": "Y estas son las equivalencias en kgf/cm² que el post publica junto a cada expresión:"
    },
    {
      "id": "r170",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 8832,
      "src": "k_Vc := 0.17*fconv ="
    },
    {
      "id": "r171",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 8880,
      "src": "k_biela := 0.66*fconv ="
    },
    {
      "id": "r172",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 8928,
      "src": "k_smax := 0.33*fconv ="
    },
    {
      "id": "r173",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 8976,
      "src": "k_Avmin := 0.083*fconv ="
    },
    {
      "id": "r174",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 9024,
      "src": "k_piso := 0.35 MPa = kgf/cm^2"
    },
    {
      "id": "r175",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 9072,
      "src": "Para comparar, el mismo V_c con el 0,53 de la edición inch-pound:"
    },
    {
      "id": "r176",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 9120,
      "src": "rfck := sqrt(f_c/(1 kgf/cm^2))*kgf/cm^2 = kgf/cm^2"
    },
    {
      "id": "r177",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 9184,
      "src": "V_c_ip := 0.53*rfck*b_w*d = tonf"
    },
    {
      "id": "r178",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 9232,
      "src": "brecha := V_c/V_c_ip - 1 ="
    },
    {
      "id": "r179",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 9296,
      "src": "━━ 6 · CONTRASTE CON EL POST — cada número publicado, contra el calculado ━━"
    },
    {
      "id": "r180",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 9344,
      "src": "Tolerancia: media unidad del último dígito publicado. El post calcula a partir del d"
    },
    {
      "id": "r181",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 9392,
      "src": "derivado (53,75 cm) y con los coeficientes de la edición SI; la hoja hace lo mismo desde"
    },
    {
      "id": "r182",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 9440,
      "src": "la norma, sin mirar los pasos intermedios del post."
    },
    {
      "id": "r183",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 9488,
      "src": "§ El caso — cargas y solicitaciones:"
    },
    {
      "id": "c_wu",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 9536,
      "src": "abs(w_u - 6.0 tonf/m) < 0.05 tonf/m ="
    },
    {
      "id": "c_Mu",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 9584,
      "src": "abs(M_u - 27 tonf*m) < 0.5 tonf*m ="
    },
    {
      "id": "c_Vuap",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 9632,
      "src": "abs(V_uap - 18 tonf) < 0.5 tonf ="
    },
    {
      "id": "r187",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 9680,
      "src": "§1 — altura mínima y altura útil. El uso 0,63 de la tabla es el redondeo de 0,625:"
    },
    {
      "id": "c_hmin",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 9728,
      "src": "abs(h_min - 37.5 cm) < 0.05 cm ="
    },
    {
      "id": "c_uh",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 9776,
      "src": "abs(u_h - 0.625) < 0.0005 ="
    },
    {
      "id": "c_d",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 9824,
      "src": "abs(d - 53.75 cm) < 0.005 cm ="
    },
    {
      "id": "r191",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 9872,
      "src": "§2 — armadura, bloque y separación libre entre barras:"
    },
    {
      "id": "c_As",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 9920,
      "src": "abs(A_s - 14.73 cm^2) < 0.005 cm^2 ="
    },
    {
      "id": "c_a",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 9968,
      "src": "abs(a - 9.70 cm) < 0.005 cm ="
    },
    {
      "id": "c_c",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 10016,
      "src": "abs(c - 11.41 cm) < 0.005 cm ="
    },
    {
      "id": "c_slibre",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 10064,
      "src": "abs(s_libre - 6.25 cm) < 0.005 cm ="
    },
    {
      "id": "r196",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 10112,
      "src": "§2.1 — ductilidad: la deformación, la de fluencia y el umbral de la Tabla 21.2.2:"
    },
    {
      "id": "c_epst",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 10160,
      "src": "abs(eps_t - 0.0111) < 0.00005 ="
    },
    {
      "id": "c_epsty",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 10208,
      "src": "abs(eps_ty - 0.00206) < 0.000005 ="
    },
    {
      "id": "c_epslim",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 10256,
      "src": "abs(eps_lim - 0.00506) < 0.000005 ="
    },
    {
      "id": "c_cdt",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 10304,
      "src": "abs(cdt - 0.21) < 0.005 ="
    },
    {
      "id": "c_cdtlim",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 10352,
      "src": "abs(cdt_lim - 0.372) < 0.0005 ="
    },
    {
      "id": "r202",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 10400,
      "src": "§2.1 — capacidad a flexión y su uso, el número insignia del post:"
    },
    {
      "id": "c_RdM",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 10448,
      "src": "abs(Rd_M - 27.2 tonf*m) < 0.05 tonf*m ="
    },
    {
      "id": "c_uM",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 10496,
      "src": "abs(u_M - 0.99) < 0.005 ="
    },
    {
      "id": "r205",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 10544,
      "src": "§2.2 — refuerzo mínimo: las dos cuantías (adimensionales, evaluadas en MPa) y el área:"
    },
    {
      "id": "c_rhoa",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 10592,
      "src": "abs(rho_a - 0.00301) < 0.000005 ="
    },
    {
      "id": "c_rhob",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 10640,
      "src": "abs(rho_b - 0.00340) < 0.000005 ="
    },
    {
      "id": "c_Asmin",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 10688,
      "src": "abs(A_smin - 5.48 cm^2) < 0.005 cm^2 ="
    },
    {
      "id": "r209",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 10736,
      "src": "§3 — corte de diseño (el post publica 14,78, el redondeo de 14,775), aporte del"
    },
    {
      "id": "r210",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 10784,
      "src": "hormigón y el gatillo de la Sec. 9.6.3.1:"
    },
    {
      "id": "c_Vud",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 10832,
      "src": "abs(V_ud - 14.775 tonf) < 0.0005 tonf ="
    },
    {
      "id": "c_Vc",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 10880,
      "src": "abs(V_c - 13.84 tonf) < 0.005 tonf ="
    },
    {
      "id": "c_RdVc",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 10928,
      "src": "abs(Rd_Vc - 10.38 tonf) < 0.005 tonf ="
    },
    {
      "id": "c_Vtrig",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 10976,
      "src": "abs(V_trig - 5.07 tonf) < 0.005 tonf ="
    },
    {
      "id": "r215",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 11024,
      "src": "§3.2 — estribos requeridos, tope de biela y espaciamiento por resistencia:"
    },
    {
      "id": "c_Vsreq",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 11072,
      "src": "abs(V_sreq - 5.86 tonf) < 0.005 tonf ="
    },
    {
      "id": "c_Vstop",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 11120,
      "src": "abs(V_stop - 53.7 tonf) < 0.05 tonf ="
    },
    {
      "id": "c_ubiela",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 11168,
      "src": "abs(u_biela - 0.11) < 0.005 ="
    },
    {
      "id": "c_Av",
      "kind": "math",
